# nix build result symlinks
result
result-*

# Zig build (see docs/ZIG_BUILD.md). zig-pkg/ is where Zig 0.16 unpacks the
# fetched Boost/Protobuf/Catch2 packages; zig-out/ and .zig-cache/ are the
# install prefix and the build cache. Message.pb.* and Version.h are generated
# into the build cache, never into the source tree, but the CMake build can be
# pointed at an in-tree binary directory, so ignore them here too.
zig-out/
.zig-cache/
zig-pkg/
Message.pb.h
Message.pb.cc
src/Version.h
